<title>USA: AMBAC qualifies two muni bond issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>AMBAC qualifies two muni bond issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMBAC Indemnity Corp said Wednesday it qualified for bond insurance the following two municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today:</p>
<p>--Eaton County, Mich., $2.295 million water supply and sewerage district bonds.</p>
<p>--Salem, Ore., $6 million general obligation bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
